TASK:
Evaluate this lead and score it using this scale:
- 8 to 10: Hot (Urgent timeline, clear budget, high pain point)
- 4 to 7: Medium/Warm (Exploring options for next quarter/year, valid business domain, information gathering)
- 1 to 3: Low/Spam (Solicitation, SEO/crypto spam, or free email with vague/unrelated text)

Return ONLY a valid JSON object with NO markdown formatting, NO backticks, and NO extra commentary. Use this exact structure:
{
  "qualification_score": <integer from 1 to 10>,
  "buyer_intent": "<High | Medium | Low | Spam>",
  "ai_summary": "<2-sentence summary combining what their company does and what they need>",
  "pain_points": "<comma-separated list of key challenges mentioned>",
  "draft_reply": "<A warm, concise, personalized email reply to {{ $('Re organise and properly structure data -   Edit Fields').item.json.Customer_name }} referencing their specific company business and inquiry>"
}

